{"file_name": "2fa0862e958d7c9d.pdf", "category": "hr", "text": "SACHA DUBOIS\n\nHR PROFESSIONAL\n\nPERSONAL HISTORY\n\nI have been working in Human\nResources for over seven years.\nAs an executive recruiter, I\nmake sure to find the right\nperson fit for the job.\n\nTALENT AND SKILLS\n\n- Familiar with multiple\nemployment sites and programs\n- Extensive experience doing\ncandidate background checks\n\n- Excellent interviewing\ntechniques\n\nCONTACT INFORMATION\n\nAddress: 128 Anywhere St., Any\nCity, State, Country 12345\nPhone: (123) 456-7890\n\nEmail:\nhello@reallygreatsite.com\nWebsite:\nwww.reallygreatsite.com\n\nCAREER HISTORY\n\nEXECUTIVE RECRUITER\nExcelland Recruitment | December 2020 - present\n\n- Searches for ideal candidates for C-level positions for major\ncorporations\n\n- Interviews and follows up on applications for upper\nmanagement positions\n\nHUMAN RESOURCES MANAGER\n\nBWF International | March 2017 - November 2020\n\n- Managed day-to-day operations of Human Resources\ndepartment\n\n- Interviewed applicants to fill open upper management\npositions in the company\n\nACADEMIC HISTORY\n\nWILLOWARNE COLLEGE\nMasters in HRM | Graduated December 2020\n- Master's thesis topic: Human Resource Management\n\ntechniques for long-term employee development\n- Awarded recognition for academic achievement\n\nHUXLENSE UNIVERSITY\nBA Human Resources | Graduated April 2016\n\n- Graduated with academic honors: Summa Cum Laude\n- Recipient of the Huxlense Student Achievement Scholarship\n- Student Government Association officer\n\nPROFESSIONAL AWARDS\n\n- Outstanding Performance, BWF International 2018 & 2019\n- Industry Recognition Award for Human Resources, Regional\nCoalition of HRM Professionals 2020", "embedding": [-0.07973062247037888, -0.0018355902284383774, -0.01684904284775257, 0.0288684219121933, -0.01053638756275177, -0.007438067812472582, -0.015602379105985165, -0.011331470683217049, -0.046015415340662, -0.011632435023784637, -0.043664708733558655, -0